    <item>
      <title>v1.5.0</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 14:55:06 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[<pre style="font-family: -apple-system; white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0">Release v1.5.0: What&#x27;s New sheet after every update<br/><br/>- After an update, Grabbit shows a What&#x27;s New sheet with the release<br/>  highlights. The notes are bundled at build time from the release<br/>  commit, so it works offline and appears exactly once per version.<br/>- Sparkle&#x27;s update dialog now shows the same release notes: the appcast<br/>  item carries a description built from the tagged commit message, and<br/>  the GitHub release notes come from the same text.<br/>- The notes parser drops the &quot;N tests / 0 failures.&quot; trailer.<br/><br/>410 tests / 0 failures.</pre>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/sankahchan/grabbit/releases/download/v1.5.0/Grabbit-v1.5.0.dmg" sparkle:version="1.5.0" sparkle:shortVersionString="1.5.0" sparkle:edSignature="twa8AiRM2hwGVY+LJPhiv4T8poC0ft8yqS/pVUv5N/Go9Wkt1BMNc9pFvcxKB08KXSSCjm7xTsTkzhsF0hM9DA==" type="application/octet-stream"/>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>v1.5.1</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 15:02:23 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[<pre style="font-family: -apple-system; white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0">Release v1.5.1: fix the update loop (build number now tracks the version)<br/><br/>- Sparkle compares the appcast&#x27;s sparkle:version against the app&#x27;s<br/>  CFBundleVersion. That build number was hardcoded to &quot;1&quot;, so every<br/>  check reported an update even right after installing one (the dialog<br/>  said &quot;you have 1.5.0 (1)&quot;). CFBundleVersion now tracks the release<br/>  version, and the release workflow forces both plist keys from the tag<br/>  before signing so they can never drift again.<br/><br/>410 tests / 0 failures.</pre>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/sankahchan/grabbit/releases/download/v1.5.1/Grabbit-v1.5.1.dmg" sparkle:version="1.5.1" sparkle:shortVersionString="1.5.1" sparkle:edSignature="vqIF8DKyaNhiKz5VUvunuAZ+V9waZ37ReR1cs0AfkbFRoakS59ri6NcYxMXdiRc4Sp7RADp/tW3SWvnhJSQDDQ==" type="application/octet-stream"/>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>v1.5.2</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 10:23:35 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[<pre style="font-family: -apple-system; white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0">Release v1.5.2: GitHub-first extension distribution<br/><br/>- Every release now also attaches grabbit-extension-latest.zip, giving a<br/>  stable download URL:<br/>  releases/latest/download/grabbit-extension-latest.zip<br/>- README + GrabbitExtension/README document the release-ZIP install<br/>  (unzip -&gt; Load unpacked -&gt; the app connects it automatically since<br/>  v1.3.0); install-host.sh stays as the development fallback.<br/>- The Grabber tab shows a Get the extension button opening the latest<br/>  release when no host manifest is installed.<br/><br/>410 tests / 0 failures.</pre>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/sankahchan/grabbit/releases/download/v1.5.2/Grabbit-v1.5.2.dmg" sparkle:version="1.5.2" sparkle:shortVersionString="1.5.2" sparkle:edSignature="aXpNk+E5g3TyMn6T190ICAmXciALsXDEektPEl6NPbHK1eWWI8WVTs7TAB+rDCaLit7rKrJd4QoE9CPwoa8PAA==" type="application/octet-stream"/>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
